      "content": "<p></p><p>Selecting a good neighborhood in Bangalore can play a significant role in shaping your lifestyle and comfort. Whitefield and Hennur are two well-known localities that provide a different living experience. This in-depth comparison will guide you to choose the neighborhood best suited for your taste and requirements.</p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" data-doc-type=\"writer\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span><p></p><h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" data-doc-type=\"writer\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Table of Contents</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocqkqh5yecr0w3\",\"id\":\"toc_gg78xig3qfet\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_gg78xig3qfet\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p></p><ul><li>&nbsp;<span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Location Overview<br></span></li><li>Connectivity &amp; Infrastructure<br></li><li>Residential Developments<br></li><li>Average Rental Price</li><li>Social Infrastructure &amp; Lifestyle<br></li><li>Environment &amp; Living Experience</li><li>Who Should Choose Whitefield?<br></li><li>Who Should Choose Hennur?<br></li><li>Final Verdict<br></li><li>FAQs<br></li></ul><h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Location Overview</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocrdqbhbqa0jl7\",\"id\":\"toc_q0mw07krzzsb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_q0mw07krzzsb\">&nbsp;</span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocrdqbhbqa0jl7\",\"id\":\"toc_q0mw07krzzsb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_q0mw07krzzsb\"><b>&nbsp;</b><br></span></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><h3><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Whitefield:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Situated in East Bangalore, <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/why-whitefield-stands-out-as-a-premier-locality-in-bangalore\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Whitefield</a> is one of the oldest and most established suburbs of the city. It was a peaceful settlement until it became a prominent IT and residential area after the tech boom. It houses many IT parks, shopping malls, and well-settled communities.</span><br><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><h3><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Hennur:</span></h3><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Situated in North Bangalore,<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/pros-and-cons-of-living-in-hennur-bangalore\" target=\"_blank\"><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-hennur-all-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Hennur</a><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-hennur-all-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\"> </a></a>is an emerging residential area gaining popularity due to its strategic location near the airport and growing tech corridors. While still developing, it offers a quieter alternative to the hustle of Bangalore’s more crowded localities.</span><p></p><p></p><h2 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b><br>Connectivity &amp; Infrastructure<br><br></b></h2><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Factor</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>Whitefield</b></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Hennur</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Road Connectivity</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Connected via Outer Ring Road (ORR), Whitefield Main Road, and Old Airport Road</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Linked to ORR, Bellary Road, and Hennur Road with ongoing road widening projects</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Metro Access</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Purple Line of Namma Metro connects Whitefield to central Bangalore</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Metro extension planned but not yet operational; currently reliant on road transport</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Public Transport</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Extensive BMTC bus network and metro services</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>Limited BMTC services; improving with new routes</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Proximity to Airport</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Approximately 45 minutes via ORR</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Around 25-30 minutes, closer to Kempegowda International Airport</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Whitefield enjoys well-established infrastructure and metro connectivity, facilitating easy daily commutes. Hennur is also developing fast, with infrastructure development projects in progress to improve accessibility.<br></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br></span></p><h2><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Residential Developments</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocoqk6e2rsb740\",\"id\":\"toc_k2j74mw3hns7\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k2j74mw3hns7\">&nbsp;</span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocoqk6e2rsb740\",\"id\":\"toc_k2j74mw3hns7\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k2j74mw3hns7\"><b>&nbsp;</b><br></span></span></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><br></b></span></p><h3><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Whitefield:</span></h3><p><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Offers a mature real estate market with a variety of housing options including luxury apartments, villas, and gated communities. Projects by reputed developers provide premium amenities and a cosmopolitan lifestyle.</span><br><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></span></p><h3><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Hennur:</span></span></h3><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Primarily features mid-segment <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-hennur\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">apartments for rent in hennur</a> and affordable housing projects. It attracts renters and those seeking quieter neighborhoods with potential for appreciation.</span></span><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br class=\"zw-br\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></span></p><h2><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Average rental price<br><br></b></span></span></h2><p></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Average Rent</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>Whitefield</b></p></td><td><p><b><br></b></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Hennur</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">1BHK</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹15,000 – ₹30,000/month</span></p></td><td><p><br></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹8,000 – ₹17,000</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">2 BHK</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹25,000-₹45,000/month</span></p></td><td><p><br></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹25,000-₹35,000/month</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">3 </span>BHK</p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">35, – </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">₹50,000/month</span></p></td><td><p><br></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">30,000 – </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">₹40,000/month</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Whitefield commands higher prices due to its established status and amenities, while Hennur offers more affordable options with promising future growth.</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></span></p><h2><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><br>Social Infrastructure &amp; Lifestyle<br><br></b></span></h2><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Factor</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Whitefield</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Hennur</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Schools</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Vydehi School, Ryan International, Deens Academy</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">HMR International, New Horizon International, Vibgyor High School</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Hospitals</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Manipal Hospital, Columbia Asia, Aster hospital</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Hosmat Hospital, Cloudnine Hospital, Sunshine Hospital</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Shopping &amp; Entertainment</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Phoenix Marketcity, VR Bengaluru, Forum Value Mall</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Elements Mall,Phoenix mall of Asia,Bharatiya Mall</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Lifestyle</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Cosmopolitan, vibrant, with numerous leisure options</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001020008\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Quieter, less congested, ideal for those seeking peace</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>Environment &amp; Living Experience</span><spa